<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Day 49 - Abstract Words ✨</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@picocss/pico@2/css/pico.min.css">

<style>
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;
  background:linear-gradient(to bottom,#fff9dc,#fffacd);
  text-align:center;
  position:relative;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

.star{
  position:absolute;
  width:2px;
  height:2px;
  background:white;
  border-radius:50%;
  opacity:0;
  animation:twinkle 3s infinite;
}

@keyframes twinkle{
  0%,100%{opacity:0;}
  50%{opacity:1;}
}

.stars-container{
  position:fixed;
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  z-index:0;
}

main{position:relative;z-index:2;}

h1{
  font-size:3rem;
  color:#d35400;
  margin-top:50px;
}

.highlight{
  font-size:2rem;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin:20px auto;
  max-width:700px;
  padding:20px;
  border-radius:20px;
  background:rgba(255,250,200,0.85);
}

.verse{
  font-style:italic;
  margin:25px auto;
  max-width:800px;
  background:white;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:20px;
}

.description{
  max-width:850px;
  margin:20px auto;
  background:rgba(255,250,200,0.85);
  padding:20px;
  border-radius:20px;
  text-align:left;
}

.vocab-box{
  background:white;
  padding:15px;
  margin:10px auto;
  max-width:850px;
  text-align:left;
  border-left:6px solid gold;
  border-radius:10px;
}

.vocab-word{
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#c0392b;
}

footer{
  margin:40px 0;
  color:#555;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="stars-container"></div>

<main class="container">

<h1>Day 49 🌟</h1>

<div class="highlight">
Abstract Words ✨<br>
<span style="font-size:1.3rem;">ধারণাগত শব্দ 🌟</span>
</div>

<div class="verse">
“For I know the plans I have for you,” declares the Lord, “plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future.”<br>
<strong>Jeremiah 29:11 🙏</strong>
</div>

<div class="description">
এই শব্দগুলো ধারণা, অনুভূতি এবং জীবনের লক্ষ্য সম্পর্কিত। এগুলো আমাদের ভবিষ্যৎ ও স্বপ্ন সম্পর্কে ভাবতে সাহায্য করে। ✨
</div>

<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Freedom</span> – স্বাধীনতা<br><i>Freedom is important.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Success</span> – সাফল্য<br><i>Hard work brings success.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Failure</span> – ব্যর্থতা<br><i>Failure teaches lessons.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Hope</span> – আশা<br><i>Never lose hope.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Dream</span> – স্বপ্ন<br><i>I have a big dream.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Goal</span> – লক্ষ্য<br><i>My goal is clear.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Effort</span> – চেষ্টা<br><i>Make more effort.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Progress</span> – অগ্রগতি<br><i>She made good progress.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Chance</span> – সুযোগ<br><i>Give me a chance.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Opportunity</span> – সুযোগ<br><i>This is a good opportunity.</i></div>

<footer>
© 2026 Tatzliach Education ⭐
</footer>

</main>

<script>
const container=document.querySelector('.stars-container');
for(let i=0;i<50;i++){
let star=document.createElement('div');
star.classList.add('star');
star.style.top=Math.random()*100+'%';
star.style.left=Math.random()*100+'%';
container.appendChild(star);
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
